^SAMPLE = GSM3790555
!Sample_title = Panc1_NTC1
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM3790555
!Sample_status = Public on Jun 01 2020
!Sample_submission_date = May 21 2019
!Sample_last_update_date = Jun 01 2020
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = Panc-1 cell line
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: Panc-1 cell line
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = crispr guide: Non-targeting guide 1
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line modification: Stable integration of Lenti-dCas9-VP46-Blast (Addgene $61425) and lenti-MS2-p65-HSF1-Hygro (Addgene #61425)
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = All cells were grown under the same conditions. Each of three pools of cells were infected with a plastmid containing a sgRNA targeting a random genomic segment or the ABCG2 gene. Cells were selected for integration of the plasmid using blasticidin (10ug/ml)
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Panc 1 cells were grown in DMEM with 10% FBS, 0.5% PenStrep, 0.5% Glutamax. They were maintained at 37C and 5%CO2
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = 3x10^5 cells were suspended in RL buffer with BME. Total RNA was extracted with the Norgen Total RNA extraction kit, including DNAse kit.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = NEBNext Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina with polyA selection
!Sample_description = GEOSubmission_CountTableABCG2.xlsx
!Sample_data_processing = adapter trimming using trimgalore v0.4.1
!Sample_data_processing = fastqc v0.11.7 for quality score assessment
!Sample_data_processing = star version v2.4.2a for alignment
!Sample_data_processing = ht-seq-gene v 0.5.3 to consoldiate reads to features
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: xlsx spreadsheet containing raw count data for each of the four samples across all measured genes.
